---
// The Leat wordmark: the name over a pipeline of four stages, three passed
// and the last one live. Text plus inline SVG, so it stays crisp and follows
// the light and dark theme.
---

<span class="wordmark" aria-hidden="true">leat<svg class="wm-pipeline" viewBox="0 0 102 16"><path class="wm-line" d="M6 8H96" /><circle class="wm-stage" cx="6" cy="8" r="4.2" /><circle class="wm-stage" cx="36" cy="8" r="4.2" /><circle class="wm-stage" cx="66" cy="8" r="4.2" /><circle class="wm-live" cx="96" cy="8" r="5.6" /></svg></span>
